# Regenerated by debian/rules on every build (override_dh_auto_build) -
# never commit these; a fresh checkout needs one build before they exist
# on disk. verify-iso-sig.1 in particular embeds the exact pandoc
# version it was built with in its own first line, so committing it
# would show a diff on every machine with a different pandoc version,
# even with no real content change.
/verify-iso-sig.desktop
/verify-iso-sig.1
/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.mo
/help/

# Debian packaging build state (debhelper's own scratch area) - always
# regenerated, never meant to be committed.
/debian/.debhelper/
/debian/debhelper-build-stamp
/debian/files
/debian/*.substvars
/debian/*.debhelper.log
/debian/verify-iso-sig/

# dpkg-buildpackage/debuild output normally lands one directory above
# wherever debian/ lives (outside this repo, if debian/ sits at the repo
# root as usual - see this project's own ./build script) - kept here too
# as a safety net in case a build ever runs in a way that puts them
# inside this tree instead.
/*.deb
/*.build
/*.buildinfo
/*.changes
/*.dsc
/*.tar.gz
/*.tar.xz
/*.upload

# Editor/OS cruft
*~
.*.swp
.DS_Store
